1. New method `Ed25519PublicKey::from_spki_pem(pem: &[u8]) -> Result<Ed25519PublicKey, ImportPublicKeyError>`. It parses PEM strictly, decodes base64, then delegates to `from_spki_der`. Reuse `ImportPublicKeyError::Malformed` for PEM format errors — the requirement says "返回调用方能按类型识别的格式错误" — same typed error, Malformed variant. That keeps a single error type for both entries. Good.

